{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444550/extras/steamBanner.png?t=1462350363\" /><br><strong>Void</strong> 21 is a procedurally generated, arcade style, fast-paced runner and shooter. You are a pilot training with the highly maneuverable and lethal Void ship. Your objective is to reach the end of the level, either as quickly or as violently as possible (or both?).<br><br><i>&quot;It\u2019s a great title, with a lot to offer. It\u2019s frankly nigh on impossible to finish everything the game has to offer&quot;</i> - Final Boss Fight<br><br><br>Key Features<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedurally generated levels (36^8 possible playable levels)<br></li><li>Upgradeable ship modules to fit your playstyle <br></li><li>Multiple challenging enemies with unique AI<br></li><li>Objectives that unlock upgrades to level-up your ship<br></li><li>Daily procedurally generated challenges <br></li><li>Seed picker so you can challenge your friends or play your favorite level again and again<br></li><li>Targeting max resolution of 4K@144FPS<br></li><li>Oculus Rift Support (DK2 + CV1) v1.3</li></ul><br>Game can run at unlocked framerate and any available resolution.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Future Items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Mac and Linux Support<br></li><li> Steam VR Support</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Missing the Mark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/444550/d7ad2249bcc1a39bc1c401ef045e1d13d7f3dd26.jpg"},{"name":"The meaning of Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/444550/02dd111559c307dba7d5e07f98bdd7d27cd63e45.jpg"},{"name":"SUPERSONIC","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/444550/840292abf482d1a6c078bf8934f2c5fe9fdb69d4.jpg"},{"name":"Orient Express","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/444550/24be6922c6f6903